# This file is a placeholder to keep the results/ directory in the repository.
#
# After running the benchmark, the following files will be generated here:
#
#     results.csv           - raw benchmark results (9 scenarios x 12 methods x 10 seeds)
#     ablation.csv          - ablation study results (A1-A5)
#     sensitivity_S1.csv    - latent-dimension sensitivity results for S1
#     sensitivity_S2.csv    - latent-dimension sensitivity results for S2
#     wilcoxon.csv          - Wilcoxon test results
#     friedman.csv          - Friedman test results
#     ranking.csv           - mean AIC ranking across scenarios
#
#     figures/              - all publication figures (PNG)
#     tables/               - LaTeX tables
